---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const STREAM_SRC =
  'https://customer-wa9cpywo3l4jte5c.cloudflarestream.com/b687f8087e0bcbe2695074f2d88dec95/iframe?muted=true&loop=true&autoplay=true&poster=https%3A%2F%2Fcustomer-wa9cpywo3l4jte5c.cloudflarestream.com%2Fb687f8087e0bcbe2695074f2d88dec95%2Fthumbnails%2Fthumbnail.jpg%3Ftime%3D%26height%3D600&controls=false';
---

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-rose-950">
      <div class="relative w-full min-h-[72svh] sm:min-h-[28rem] md:min-h-0 md:aspect-[1.843]">
        <iframe
          src={STREAM_SRC}
          title="Essence Wax Studio hero video"
          loading="eager"
          class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full border-0"
          style="border: none; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; width: 100%;"
          allow="accelerometer; gyroscope; autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;"
          allowfullscreen="true"
        ></iframe>
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-rose-950/95 via-rose-950/35 to-transparent sm:from-rose-950 sm:via-rose-950/50 sm:to-rose-950/20"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end">
          <div class="container-narrow w-full pb-8 pt-28 sm:pb-12 sm:pt-20">
            <p class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-300 sm:text-xs">
              Brazilian Wax · Hard Wax · Private Studio
            </p>
            <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
              Essence <span class="italic text-gold-300">Wax Studio</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-ivory-100/90 sm:mt-5 sm:text-lg">
              A quiet, appointment-led studio concept for Brazilian waxing — precise work, lasting smoothness.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:mt-8 sm:flex-row sm:gap-3">
              <a href="#method" class="btn-primary pointer-events-auto">The Method</a>
              <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-secondary pointer-events-auto">Domain Available</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="method" class="section-padding bg-ivory-50">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-rose-600">The Method</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-rose-950 sm:text-5xl">Smoothness that lasts</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-rose-800 sm:text-lg">
            Wax epilation extracts hair from the root using warm or hard wax, providing smooth skin for 3 to 4 weeks.
            The sensation is short and sharp rather than the continuous pinch of mechanical epilation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-950">Effectiveness</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-rose-700">Removes coarse and fine hair. With consistent sessions, regrowth often becomes finer over time.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-950">Best for</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-rose-700">Ideal for the bikini line and underarms — especially with hard wax, which adheres to hair, not skin.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-950">Preparation</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-rose-700">Hair should be at least ¼ to ½ inch long. Time between visits is part of the method.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-950">Skin impact</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-rose-700">Gentle exfoliation as dead skin lifts with the wax. Temporary redness can occur and typically settles quickly.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="studio" class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-rose-600">The Studio</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-rose-950 sm:text-5xl">Private by design</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-rose-800 sm:text-lg">
            Essence is a studio name, not a high-volume salon floor. It suggests unhurried appointments, hard-wax technique, and a room that stays quiet.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm text-rose-800 sm:text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500"></span><span>Hard wax preferred for Brazilian and underarm work.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500"></span><span>Results that last 3 to 4 weeks.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500"></span><span>An appointment-led format with a refined brand presence.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-rose-100 bg-ivory-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dl class="space-y-5">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rose-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-rose-600">Format</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-900">Private studio</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rose-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-rose-600">Signature service</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-900">Brazilian</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rose-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-rose-600">Duration</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-900">3–4 weeks</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-rose-600">Preferred wax</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-rose-900">Hard wax</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="brand" class="section-padding bg-ivory-50">
      <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl text-center">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-rose-600">The Domain</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-rose-950 sm:text-5xl">Why this name</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-rose-800 sm:text-base">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-rose-950">EssenceWaxStudio.com</strong> reads as a complete brand: mood, category, and setting.
            It works on a window, a booking page, and a search result.
          </p>
          <p>
            Available for a boutique wax studio or a beauty operator who wants a refined, studio-first identity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-rose-100 bg-white py-10 sm:py-12">
      <div class="container-narrow text-center">
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-rose-600 sm:text-sm">
          Information presented is for demonstration and educational purposes only and does not constitute an offer of salon services.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
